      "start": 6,
      "end": 14.1,
      "text": "We stood down the crane from one to three, so no precast picks for two hours, the erection crew did connections and grouting instead."
    },
    {
      "messageId": "e0000010-0000-4000-8000-000000001001",
      "start": 14.1,
      "end": 21,
      "text": "Before that we set nine double tees on level three."
    },
    {
      "messageId": "e0000010-0000-4000-8000-000000001001",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 28.3,
      "text": "Apex, three guys, full day on the ramp B pour prep. Ironclad, three, full day, rebar on the level two post-tension deck."
    },
    {
      "messageId": "e0000010-0000-4000-8000-000000001001",
